            <ArticleTitle>[Cardiohemodynamics and biochemical indices of the blood during experimental hemosorption using a fibrous sorbent].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the experiment, it was established that hemosorption by means of fibrous polymeric sorbent led to reduction in the concentration of the toxic products of metabolism in the blood, normalization of cardiohemodynamics. Practically, there were no losses of total protein, and a certain concentration of hormones in the blood retained.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
